  <metadata>
    <name>Mazbānīša taka: Mazirbe–Sīkrags</name>
    <desc>Established one-way former narrow-gauge railway trail from the signed Mazirbe start to the village road junction in Sīkrags. This is the outward Mazirbe–Sīkrags section of the official loop GPX, excluding the longer western extension and coastal return. Source coordinates preserved, retrieved 2026-09-05. Arrange onward transport; return walking distance is additional.</desc>
    <link href="https://visittalsi.com/kurp-doties/dabas-objekti/mazbanisa-dabas-taka/" />
    <link href="https://kurzemesregions.lv/projekti/turisms/unigreen/dabas-takas/mazbanisa-dabas-taka/" />
    <link href="https://kurzemesregions.lv/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/Narrow_gauge_railway_trail.gpx" />
  </metadata>
